      "value": "Field Medic"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "pc1"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "In the chaotic rush of battle, you learned to adapt to rapidly changing conditions as you administered to battle casualties.\n\nYou patched up soldiers, guards, or other combatants, and learned a fair amount about the logistics of war.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Medicine skill and the Warfare Lore skill. You gain the Battle Medicine skill feat."
    },
